      "description": "Basic request flow",
      "narrationSegment": "A REST API architecture starts with a load balancer distributing traffic across multiple API server instances. Nginx uses round-robin to balance requests, each server handles HTTP input validation and executes business logic before returning JSON responses with sub-50ms latency.",
