      "endTime": 10000,
      "description": "Add caching layer",
      "narrationSegment": "Adding Redis as a caching layer dramatically reduces database load. The API server checks Redis first — cache hits return in under 1 millisecond. Cache misses fall through to PostgreSQL, and the result is cached for subsequent requests. This typically reduces database queries by 80 to 90 percent.",
